WEBVTT

00:00.279 --> 00:04.279
Welcome to Mizu Kappa, a growing digital ecosystem,
bringing multiple utilities together

00:04.279 --> 00:05.979
in one platform.

00:07.726 --> 00:11.756
Build your network with a structured 1 to 15 level referral program.

00:14.363 --> 00:16.893
Swap supported digital assets

00:17.333 --> 00:20.083
through a simple and intuitive interface.

00:20.932 --> 00:23.712
Stake supported digital assets through Mizu Kappa.

00:24.012 --> 00:26.472
Track your staking position and applicable rewards

00:26.852 --> 00:28.712
directly from your dashboard.

00:30.224 --> 00:35.084
Explore the Mizu Kappa marketplace for products,
digital items, and services.

00:36.561 --> 00:40.451
Access everyday digital services, including airtime and data,
cable TV subscriptions,

00:40.451 --> 00:42.531
electricity payments, and other supported payments.

00:42.943 --> 00:44.823
Access a Mizu Kappa bank card.

00:45.333 --> 00:47.883
Connect supported crypto assets with fiat spending,

00:48.333 --> 00:50.153
with referral rewards where applicable.

00:50.840 --> 00:54.730
Connect your wallet and access decentralized exchange functionality

00:54.730 --> 00:56.590
for supported on-chain assets.

00:57.697 --> 1:00.677
Mizu Kappa brings digital assets, payments,
commerce, cards,

01:00.677 --> 1:02.137
referrals, and decentralized services.

01:02.137 --> 1:04.597
Mizu Kappa, explore the possibilities.
